+ * chopgimp-vbrush.c — ChopGimp 3.30.0: « Formes de pinceau » and
+ * « Pinceau goutte », see chopgimp-vbrush.h. The brushes are built like
+ * the Transition of chopgimp-vmaterial.c (a group with a spec, a part
+ * made again from the change hook); the geometry comes from
+ * chopgimp-geom.cc (outline, curve fitting, booleans: lib2geom).
